  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported reference-case lists, single and requested combination metadata, all-combination enumeration and family routing with comprehensive XML IntelliSense. Preserved ordered reference duplicates, deduplicated combination membership, literal titles and None classification. Reused shared bounded inventory validation and current-binding/thread/reentrancy guards without native changes. Eleven Load contracts are available; see the load-case metadata guide for contracts and qualification limits.",
